"lineNumber":69,"content":"On integrated head 7077d7f (after MARATHON-24), verify against the product specification: with /app/start.sh running, GET /api/health on 127.0.0.1:8000, :8001, and :8002 each returns 200 with JSON status exactly \\\"ok\\\" and node_id JSON numbers 0, 1, and 2 respectively; health succeeds while Redis is down; the service remains self-contained with no remote dependencies.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-194424-qa-engineer-1--b91bbc7c/diff.patch","matches":[{"lineNumber":8,"content":"+# QA verification for MARATHON-25 — start.sh self-contained port topology.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":209,"content":"+  pass \"AC8 listeners reachable only via 127.0.0.1 (self-contained, no remote broker)\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":262,"content":"+  fail \"edge double-start teardown broke original port topology\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-194424-qa-engineer-1--b91bbc7c/metadata.json","matches":[{"lineNumber":4,"content":"  \"task_id\": \"MARATHON-25\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/worktrees/app/qa-engineer-1/test/qa-port-topology.sh","matches":[{"lineNumber":2,"content":"# QA verification for MARATHON-25 — start.sh self-contained port topology.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":203,"content":"  pass \"AC8 listeners reachable only via 127.0.0.1 (self-contained, no remote broker)\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":256,"content":"  fail \"edge double-start teardown broke original port topology\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-194424-qa-engineer-1--b91bbc7c/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":58,"content":"A task is already claimed for you: **MARATHON-25**. Work on that one and no other.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":60,"content":"ID: MARATHON-25","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":61,"content":"Title: Verify: start.sh self-contained port topology","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":69,"content":"On integrated head e2704f3 (MARATHON-2), verify against the product specification: the cluster is self-contained (no remote services, no Docker-in-Docker); only one start.sh supervisor owns Redis :6379 and HTTP :8000/:8001/:8002; killing start.sh stops keeping the service up as the harness entrypoint; health does not require Redis to be up; node_id mapping must not be remapped off 8000→0, 8001→1, 8002→2.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-194422-backend-dev-1--549e5981/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":91,"content":"SQLite file locking under three processes is simpler than a real DB server, but write throughput under heavy concurrent register is limited by WAL/busy waits. Acceptable for marathon scale. Using experimental `node:sqlite` avoids npm install in air-gapped/self-contained constraints; if the API shifts, implementer may pin Node flags or swap to an equivalent sync SQLite binding **without changing the HTTP contract**.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-193520-frontend-dev-1--0036add8/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":90,"content":"SQLite file locking under three processes is simpler than a real DB server, but write throughput under heavy concurrent register is limited by WAL/busy waits. Acceptable for marathon scale. Using experimental `node:sqlite` avoids npm install in air-gapped/self-contained constraints; if the API shifts, implementer may pin Node flags or swap to an equivalent sync SQLite binding **without changing the HTTP contract**.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-193220-backend-dev-1--a57b0489/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":82,"content":"| sy